OL,3,GNEWSADrivers racing before mum and
OL,4,Achild killed - trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo drivers weaved their cars in and
OL,7,Fout of traffic at high speeds as they
OL,8,Fraced each other before a crash which
OL,9,Fkilled a mother and daughter, a jury
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FJustyna Hulboj, 27, and four-year-old
OL,13,FLena Czepczor were walking to nursery
OL,14,Fon 16 January 2023 when they were
OL,15,Fstruck by an Audi TT on the pavement on
OL,16,FScott Hall Road in Leeds.
OL,18,FJasskamal Riyat, 37, who was driving a
OL,19,FBMW 1 Series closely behind the Audi,
OL,20,Fis on trial at Leeds Crown Court
OL,21,Fcharged with causing their deaths by
OL,22,Fdangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
